## Design Rules
- ALWAYS match visual layout from /_reference/prototype_screenshots/
- Use the exact colors: dark green #0F5132 (Grove card & accents), mint accent #10B981, navy #1E293B
- Daylight sidebar: white/off-white column (`bg-white`, borders `#cdd9ea`); Midnight sidebar `#1a2437` — match `practiceHub.png`
- Reference implementation: /_reference/aistudio_prototype/

## Architecture
- 3-column shell: Left Nav (240px) | Main | Right Dock (320px)
- All types in types/index.ts (root types.ts re-exports for compatibility)
- All mock data in data/
- All data fetching via services/ layer (never inline fetch)